WEBVTT

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:47.450
I'm sorry to say,
but the BBA is no more.

00:01:47.450 --> 00:01:52.300
But we at BEGA will
accept you with open arms.

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:53.850
Kinomiya.

00:01:53.850 --> 00:01:55.780
Stuff it!

00:01:55.780 --> 00:01:59.020
Don't talk to me about
this open arms stuff!

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:04.080
I don't know what you're up to, but as long as I'm around...

00:02:06.090 --> 00:02:08.700
I won't let you
do as you please!

00:02:09.880 --> 00:02:13.090
I don't blame you.

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:16.040
Because in the past, I...

00:02:16.730 --> 00:02:19.610
Did something very
horrible to you all.

00:02:21.370 --> 00:02:24.940
But there's something
I want you to know.

00:02:24.940 --> 00:02:27.880
About BEGA's ideals and future.

00:02:28.850 --> 00:02:31.360
Ideals and future?

00:02:32.220 --> 00:02:34.880
Come with me.

00:02:42.240 --> 00:02:44.010
This way, please.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:53.300
What?

00:02:53.300 --> 00:02:57.780
Entry is restricted
to Bladers only.

00:02:58.520 --> 00:03:00.030
What?!

00:03:00.730 --> 00:03:02.800
Just who do
you take me for?!

00:03:02.800 --> 00:03:07.740
I'm the Beyblade goddess who
led the BBA team to victory!

00:03:08.200 --> 00:03:09.330
Hiromi Tachib--

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:12.650
Please wait for the
general public opening.

00:03:13.610 --> 00:03:16.560
You suits are useless!

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:19.600
Let me speak
to your manager!

00:03:19.600 --> 00:03:22.770
You won't get
away with this!

00:03:22.770 --> 00:03:26.060
There'll be another mini
concert on opening day!

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:27.380
Oh yeah?!

00:03:27.380 --> 00:03:29.620
Ming-Ming's scared!

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:32.880
Get your hands off me!

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:42.280
This is an incredible facility.

00:03:44.980 --> 00:03:46.690
Why you...

00:03:48.460 --> 00:03:49.900
So...

00:03:49.900 --> 00:03:52.170
Who is this guy?

00:03:52.450 --> 00:03:55.060
Did he and
Takao have a fight?

00:03:55.520 --> 00:03:57.260
Volkov is...

00:03:57.490 --> 00:04:01.010
Connected to the guys from the
Neo-Borg team like Yuriy and Sergey.

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:04.260
He ran the old Borg team.

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:09.180
He treated Bladers like soldiers in
his quest for world domination.

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:18.090
But after we beat him, I heard he
lost his position and went missing...

00:04:20.040 --> 00:04:23.030
I see... So he's
bad news basically!

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:25.610
I'll beat him black 'n blue!

00:04:25.610 --> 00:04:27.890
He's mine!

00:04:27.890 --> 00:04:29.680
No!

00:04:29.680 --> 00:04:33.440
We need to figure out
what he's all about!

00:04:33.440 --> 00:04:35.730
You're no fun.

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:56.560
Wow!

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:59.560
It's as good as the
old Borg or the PPB!

00:04:59.560 --> 00:05:02.000
Or even better!

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:04.450
There's more.

00:05:06.520 --> 00:05:12.140
We have all kinds of
facilities here to help Bladers.

00:05:12.600 --> 00:05:17.940
I plan to create facilities like
these all over the world.

00:05:19.160 --> 00:05:22.530
You gonna train your
soldiers here again?

00:05:22.530 --> 00:05:24.740
But Takao...

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:28.760
No one looks like they're
being forced to do anything.

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:33.410
He's just making them
put on a show, duh!

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:38.210
Spit it out!
What are you planning?

00:05:38.210 --> 00:05:43.100
I want to spread happiness to all Bladers across the world.

00:05:43.100 --> 00:05:44.070
Huh?

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:48.410
After losing to you,
after Borg was disbanded,

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:50.680
I was lost in thought.

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:55.130
Why did my
Bladers and I lose?

00:05:57.180 --> 00:05:59.650
I wandered in solitude.

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:02.730
In search for an answer.

00:06:02.730 --> 00:06:05.730
Lost in thought...

00:06:05.730 --> 00:06:08.460
I continued to ponder.

00:06:09.160 --> 00:06:14.140
Search as I did, I could
not find an answer.

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:20.840
At the end of my arduous journey, I arrived at a nameless town.

00:06:21.370 --> 00:06:24.860
Thinking my answer
would be forever lost,

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:27.860
in earnest, I had given up.

00:06:27.860 --> 00:06:29.140
And then...

00:06:35.490 --> 00:06:38.250
Your average kids, playing freely.

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:42.370
These average kids were
in love with Beyblade.

00:06:42.370 --> 00:06:45.100
Passionately and purely!

00:06:45.520 --> 00:06:48.840
Yes, just as you boys were!

00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:54.120
The answer I had been
searching for was there.

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:58.060
I finally figured it out!

00:06:58.060 --> 00:07:02.560
Beyblade is fought with
the wills of the Bladers!

00:07:02.820 --> 00:07:06.360
Every Blader's individual
characteristics must be respected.

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:10.620
Otherwise, you cannot create
Bladers who are truly strong!

00:07:11.000 --> 00:07:13.500
I never had a chance
to begin with.

00:07:13.900 --> 00:07:20.860
I tried to use Bladers as soldiers...
As soulless pawns for my own plans!

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:26.210
Truly, what I
did was foolish!

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:31.240
I used the pure passion of those
children! Their pride in Beyblade!

00:07:31.240 --> 00:07:34.330
I stepped all over it!

00:07:34.330 --> 00:07:40.400
You can curse me all you want.
The sins I committed were of my own doing!

00:07:41.050 --> 00:07:46.020
Knowing well the sins of my past, I created a new organization.

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:49.690
The Beyblade Entertainment
Global Association...

00:07:50.410 --> 00:07:51.780
BEGA!

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:58.730
There are kids all around the world who
have the talent but not the opportunities!

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:05.210
I can give those kids a safe
space and a place to Beybattle!

00:08:05.600 --> 00:08:10.050
Stronger, more advanced Beys!

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:12.880
In Beybattles unlike
which you've ever seen!

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:15.860
To give birth
to the pro league!

00:08:16.330 --> 00:08:19.420
For all of the kids
around the world!

00:08:20.440 --> 00:08:22.210
Which is why...

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:26.840
I want you, the
champion, to take part.

00:08:26.840 --> 00:08:31.970
As the champion, you can
become an amazing inspiration

00:08:31.970 --> 00:08:34.210
for the kids to
become pro Bladers...

00:08:34.690 --> 00:08:36.160
Shut up!

00:08:36.460 --> 00:08:42.410
You can't fool me! Why did you
have to get rid of Daitenji, then?!

00:08:43.740 --> 00:08:48.810
I had him resign as a result
of the reorganization.

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:51.960
Reorganization?

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:56.480
Naturally, I will reinstate his position
once our structure is set into place.

00:08:56.480 --> 00:08:59.000
As an honorary adviser.

00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:01.400
Honorary adviser?

00:09:01.400 --> 00:09:04.330
Will you accept?

00:09:04.650 --> 00:09:06.690
Shut up, shut up, shut up!

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:10.100
I won't be fooled
by all that crap!

00:09:10.100 --> 00:09:12.040
You're bad!

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:16.110
What're you forcing
people to do this time?!

00:09:19.360 --> 00:09:22.320
Say something! Creep!

00:09:27.490 --> 00:09:28.900
What?!

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:37.810
Let me go!

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:39.380
Takao!

00:09:39.380 --> 00:09:41.010
I said let go!

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:43.810
Wow! A miracle giant!

00:09:43.810 --> 00:09:46.010
He's ginormous!

00:09:46.400 --> 00:09:50.210
Do you have a problem
with Chairman Volkov?!

00:09:50.210 --> 00:09:52.100
Damn straight I do!

00:09:52.100 --> 00:09:55.460
Do you have any idea
what this guy's done?!

00:09:55.460 --> 00:09:56.960
I know the whole story!

00:09:56.960 --> 00:09:59.970
No! Volkov is
not an evil man!

00:09:59.970 --> 00:10:01.600
He totally is!

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:04.570
Wrong!
Apologize to Volkov!

00:10:04.570 --> 00:10:06.220
Never!

00:10:06.610 --> 00:10:08.780
You are one stubborn boy!

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:13.400
Takao!

00:10:14.610 --> 00:10:16.300
What the hell, man?!

00:10:16.980 --> 00:10:19.900
I'll use this to
prove my point!

00:10:19.900 --> 00:10:21.760
Now you're
speaking my language!

00:10:23.800 --> 00:10:28.300
Show me what
you're made of.

00:10:28.300 --> 00:10:31.080
My name is Moses!

00:10:31.080 --> 00:10:33.580
Alright then, Moses!

00:10:34.080 --> 00:10:35.600
Let's battle!

00:10:36.690 --> 00:10:38.800
Time to teach you a lesson.

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:43.320
Excellent. Why don't we make
it an exhibition match, then?

00:10:49.020 --> 00:10:51.970
He's Takao Kinomiya.
The champion.

00:11:24.810 --> 00:11:28.290
Everyone's obsessed over Takao...

00:11:28.290 --> 00:11:32.760
Takao's the only one
he wants to fight.

00:11:32.760 --> 00:11:36.100
If you say so, Sensei!

00:11:36.100 --> 00:11:40.250
Takao!
Don't embarrass us in there!

00:11:40.250 --> 00:11:42.960
Moses, the BEGA Blader...

00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:49.080
I wonder how
powerful he really is...

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:50.810
They're starting.

00:12:05.050 --> 00:12:07.170
What an incredibly
large Shooter!

00:12:07.170 --> 00:12:10.700
No ordinary Blader would be
able to wield that thing!

00:12:11.640 --> 00:12:14.000
Bigger don't mean better!

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:16.760
Kick his butt, Takao!

00:12:16.760 --> 00:12:20.090
--Three! Two! One!

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:22.000
--Go...

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:23.620
Shoot!

00:12:28.800 --> 00:12:32.530
Look at this guy!
He's slow as hell!

00:12:32.530 --> 00:12:35.480
I bet even Rick's
stronger than him!

00:12:35.480 --> 00:12:41.660
You're right. For an attack type,
I wonder why it's so slow...

00:12:42.170 --> 00:12:45.050
This is one of Volkov's
chosen Bladers.

00:12:45.050 --> 00:12:47.530
I know he's
stronger than this.

00:12:47.850 --> 00:12:50.500
So let's give him
a warm welcome!

00:12:50.500 --> 00:12:52.460
Go!!

00:12:58.560 --> 00:12:59.880
What?!

00:13:04.570 --> 00:13:06.320
I got blocked!

00:13:06.320 --> 00:13:08.430
His spin speed is incredible!

00:13:10.940 --> 00:13:13.160
What cautious footwork.

00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:15.880
And he times his
dodges very well.

00:13:15.880 --> 00:13:17.960
He's a real champion.

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:20.150
But...

00:13:21.890 --> 00:13:24.250
Too slow!

00:13:40.720 --> 00:13:44.290
He doesn't even compare
to Moses in attack power.

00:13:44.290 --> 00:13:48.530
I wonder who's
going to win?

00:13:49.820 --> 00:13:53.410
He's strong...!
To be able to take down that pillar...

00:13:53.410 --> 00:13:57.380
The same pillar that
knocked Takao back!

00:13:59.850 --> 00:14:03.800
No, that shouldn't be possible!
It just shouldn't be!

00:14:03.800 --> 00:14:06.120
Whoa...
That's some crazy power.

00:14:06.120 --> 00:14:11.370
He's like a tank that can
crush anything in its path!

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:16.210
A super attack type Bey that puts everything
into strength and pure destructive force...

00:14:16.210 --> 00:14:20.160
A normal Bey would have been
knocked out after getting hit by that!

00:14:20.650 --> 00:14:22.660
You better not lose, Takao!

00:14:22.660 --> 00:14:26.000
Dodge, Dragoon Galaxy Turbo!

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:37.230
This guy really
lays on the pressure...

00:14:38.240 --> 00:14:41.980
It's like I'm getting hunted
down by a huge beast.

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:46.060
I've never felt pressure
like this before!

00:14:46.060 --> 00:14:48.200
What's the matter, champion?

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:51.040
Don't run! Fight!

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:58.660
Why? Why is a Blader as strong as you working for Volkov?

00:14:58.660 --> 00:15:01.620
What are you fighting for?!

00:15:01.850 --> 00:15:03.970
To become a pro!

00:15:04.700 --> 00:15:09.240
I'm going to earn money by becoming a famous Blader!

00:15:10.020 --> 00:15:12.410
Money?
You want money?

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:19.500
I'm fighting...
For my little sister!!

00:15:19.960 --> 00:15:21.270
Little sister?!

00:15:23.540 --> 00:15:25.050
Dragoon!

00:15:27.450 --> 00:15:31.420
I'm going to cure the
illness of my bedridden sister!

00:15:31.940 --> 00:15:36.410
I need money to cure my
sister Monica's illness!

00:15:36.410 --> 00:15:46.400
For my father! My mother! My siblings!
Who work hard day in and day out!

00:15:46.800 --> 00:15:52.970
And for Volkov, the person who taught me how to Beyblade!

00:15:55.690 --> 00:15:59.240
Volkov showed me the way.

00:15:59.240 --> 00:16:04.810
He showed me how I could become a pro Blader
to save money and cure my sister's illness!

00:16:05.410 --> 00:16:09.540
I owe Volkov my life!

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:14.960
And yet...
And yet, you...!!

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:19.360
Takao!

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:26.160
Dragoon Galaxy Turbo and
Takao don't stand a chance...

00:16:26.520 --> 00:16:29.520
This guy's nutso!

00:16:39.180 --> 00:16:42.540
He's so powerful!

00:16:42.540 --> 00:16:46.130
His passion...
His dedication to victory...

00:16:46.130 --> 00:16:49.740
That's where his
power comes from.

00:16:49.740 --> 00:16:52.260
He's legit.
I'm sure of it.

00:16:52.260 --> 00:16:55.490
A real first-class Blader!

00:16:56.130 --> 00:16:59.740
But so am I!

00:17:05.650 --> 00:17:09.720
Where are you going, Brooklyn? The battle's not over yet.

00:17:13.690 --> 00:17:15.970
The white Beyblade
is going to win.

00:17:17.610 --> 00:17:19.010
What?

00:17:24.410 --> 00:17:27.000
So am I!

00:17:30.780 --> 00:17:31.940
What?!

00:17:33.080 --> 00:17:35.250
Impossible!

00:17:41.370 --> 00:17:42.810
Gigars!

00:17:58.330 --> 00:18:00.960
I lost!!

00:18:09.490 --> 00:18:11.660
Good going, Takao!

00:18:11.660 --> 00:18:13.980
He made you
work for that win!

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:17.400
I never thought you'd be able to push back against those strong attacks.

00:18:17.400 --> 00:18:19.720
Dragoon is amazing!

00:18:19.720 --> 00:18:21.620
Look.

00:18:23.660 --> 00:18:24.930
What is...

00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:28.730
Dragoon's Attack Ring!

00:18:29.450 --> 00:18:35.220
If that went on for much longer,
I don't know if I would have won.

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:41.480
Takao... These BEGA
Bladers are really good.

00:18:41.480 --> 00:18:43.730
BEGA...
Moses...

00:18:48.130 --> 00:18:51.330
That was a splendid battle.

00:18:51.330 --> 00:18:56.260
Sharp skills.
Superior technique. And guts!

00:18:56.260 --> 00:18:58.740
You win, champion.

00:18:58.740 --> 00:19:02.530
I'll have to prepare a
sturdier stadium next time.

00:19:02.880 --> 00:19:06.340
How was it?
Seeing him fight.

00:19:07.140 --> 00:19:11.680
Does he look like a soulless
solider under my command?

00:19:13.220 --> 00:19:15.780
I ask you again.

00:19:16.220 --> 00:19:19.130
Not for me.
Not for my organization.

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:23.220
But for a better future for
Beybattles and Bladers!

00:19:23.220 --> 00:19:26.640
I want you to help me!

00:19:28.720 --> 00:19:32.480
Honestly...
I don't know.

00:19:32.480 --> 00:19:36.360
I can't 100% trust you.

00:19:36.360 --> 00:19:38.720
But he...

00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:45.370
But I know Moses is a
true Blader full of passion.

00:19:45.370 --> 00:19:50.080
Thank you. Knowing
that is enough for me.

00:19:52.980 --> 00:19:59.720
I believe that you will
someday lend aid to BEGA!

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:39.340
I wonder if Kinomiya and
his friends are alright?

00:20:44.170 --> 00:20:49.410
How can you treat me, the BBA's
Beyblade goddess like that?!

00:21:00.920 --> 00:21:04.400
You got a high score!

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:12.620
Ming-Ming's impressed!

00:21:12.620 --> 00:21:15.400
BEGA!!

00:21:17.360 --> 00:21:19.280
Hey! Cut that out!

00:21:19.280 --> 00:21:23.560
Calm down, miss! Miss!!

00:22:56.410 --> 00:22:59.450
So you're Baihuzu?

00:22:59.450 --> 00:23:02.660
Looks like the full moon
isn't to blame for all this fun.

00:23:02.660 --> 00:23:05.660
Who is that?
Where are you?!

00:23:05.660 --> 00:23:09.180
Rei, look out!
Someone's coming down from the sky!

00:23:09.180 --> 00:23:12.600
Don't worry.
I can fly, so I'll be fine!

00:23:12.600 --> 00:23:15.860
You can fly?
You're certainly strange.

00:23:15.860 --> 00:23:17.480
What are you doing
all the way out here?

00:23:17.480 --> 00:23:19.080
What's your name?

00:23:19.340 --> 00:23:22.100
More importantly, I...
